{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33961","headline":"奉和鲁望蔷薇次韵 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望蔷薇次韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁绣连延满户陈，暂应遮得陆郎贫。\n红芳掩歛将迷蝶，翠蔓飘颻欲挂人。\n低拂地时如堕马，高临墙处似窥邻。\n秖应是董双成戏，剪得神霞寸寸新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33961.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33961","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}